we have new thing to learn "fetch api" it provides interface for making https requists and processing the response 
fetch is the morden way of writing code the older version called "XMLHttpRequest"

the fetch() is a method that return a promise which is fulfilled a response object representing the serrver response

how the workflow works in this fetch api so far
User input
   ↓
stored in variable
   ↓
passed to function
   ↓
used in API
   ↓
response comes back
   ↓
display on screen